  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷社交對戰俱樂部的成員\n大多都是妖精屬性寶可夢的好手。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC6963F96F7793E4EA45C0D62304FF16A0290E87684621054E1000A5927591A90FD662F59967CBE5C6C60275BF653EF59227684597D624B300200100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不過，也是有深愛\n龍屬性寶可夢的訓練家的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D904EFF0C4E5F662F67096DF1611B000A9F8D5C6C60275BF653EF592276848A137DF45BB67684300200100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "正如您所知，龍屬性的弱點是\n龍屬性、冰屬性，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n以及妖精屬性。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6B63598260A8624077E5FF0C9F8D5C6C602776845F319EDE662F000A9F8D5C6C6027300151B05C6C6027FF0C00100001BE00000A4EE553CA59967CBE5C6C6027300200100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因此，在密阿雷社交對戰俱樂部\n使用龍屬性寶可夢對戰是會吃虧的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E06B64FF0C57285BC6963F96F7793E4EA45C0D62304FF16A0290E8000A4F7F75289F8D5C6C60275BF653EF59225C0D6230662F6703540386677684300200100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "說起來那就像是由紫小姐與\n春紫小姐的關係一般……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8AAA8D774F8690A35C3150CF662F75317D2B5C0F59D08207000A66257D2B5C0F59D0768495DC4FC24E00822C2026202600100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不……她們兩位是相輔相成。\n請您忘了我剛才的比喻吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D202620265979501151694F4D662F76F88F1476F862103002000A8ACB60A85FD84E866211525B624D76846BD455BB5427300200100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在我越說越遠之前，\n讓我們進入正題吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "572862118D8A8AAA8D8A90604E4B524DFF0C000A8B9362115011903251656B63984C5427300200100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為了鍛鍊我深愛的龍屬性寶可夢，\n請和我對戰！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4E86935B934A62116DF1611B76849F8D5C6C60275BF653EF5922FF0C000A8ACB548C62115C0D6230FF0100100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等您願意和我對戰時，\n請告訴我一聲。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B4960A89858610F548C62115C0D62306642FF0C000A8ACB544A8A3462114E008072300200100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "您當然願意和我的\n龍屬性寶可夢們對戰，對吧！？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60A8757671369858610F548C62117684000A9F8D5C6C60275BF653EF592250115C0D6230FF0C5C0D5427FF01FF1F00100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "當然願意！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "757671369858610FFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "還是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9084662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為何！？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4F55FF01FF1F00100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嚐嚐攜帶龍之牙的\n寶可夢們的攻擊吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56905690651C5E369F8D4E4B72597684000A5BF653EF592250117684653B64CA5427FF0100100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然牠們都是還能進化的寶可夢……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n不過正如我一開始告訴您的，\n在密阿雷社交對戰俱樂部<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n培育龍屬性寶可夢是很辛苦的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D671367260501190FD662F908480FD9032531676845BF653EF59222026202600100001BE01000A4E0D904E6B63598262114E00958B59CB544A8A3460A87684FF0C000A57285BC6963F96F7793E4EA45C0D62304FF16A0290E800100001BE00000A57F980B29F8D5C6C60275BF653EF5922662F5F888F9B82E67684300200100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為了提高攻擊力，\n我讓牠們攜帶了龍之牙，但……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4E8663D09AD8653B64CA529BFF0C000A62118B9372605011651C5E364E869F8D4E4B7259FF0C4F462026202600100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，您真不愧是在\n超級由紫錦標賽優勝的人。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C60A8771F4E0D6127662F5728000A8D857D1A75317D2B93266A198CFD512A52DD76844EBA300200100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "既然是還能進化的寶可夢，\n我也可以選擇使用進化奇石。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65E27136662F908480FD9032531676845BF653EF5922FF0C000A62114E5F53EF4EE5907864C74F7F752890325316594777F3300200100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但畢竟春紫小姐的座右銘是\n「攻擊就是最大的防禦」啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4675627ADF66257D2B5C0F59D076845EA753F39298662F000A300C653B64CA5C31662F670059277684963279A6300D554A300200100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "話說回來，既然贏不過由紫小姐，\n我覺得春紫小姐也許該要<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n重新思考一下她的座右銘就是了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8A718AAA56DE4F86FF0C65E271368D0F4E0D904E75317D2B5C0F59D0FF0C000A621189BA5F9766257D2B5C0F59D04E5F8A318A72898100100001BE00000A91CD65B0601D80034E004E0B597976845EA753F392985C31662F4E86300200100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這龍之牙就送給您了。\n今天真是謝謝您。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90199F8D4E4B72595C3190017D6660A84E863002000A4ECA5929771F662F8B1D8B1D60A8300200100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    }
